window.products.push({"id":717043,"name":"BARCONIC® 2 oz Tall Clear Shot Glass (Pack of 12)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31ob0seMMPL._AC_.jpg","description":"Introducing our new line of BarConic Glassware. This 2 ounce Tall Clear Shot Glass is a great solution for your home bars or anyone who needs to purchase high-quality glassware for events, holidays, or gift ideas at significantly lower cost than you will find anywhere else! Serving your shooter in a tall glass is the ideal way, and this 2oz tall clear shot glass holds a little more than a standard short glass, making it a great choice for mixed and chilled shot recipes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31ob0seMMPL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BARCONIC","source_asin":"B07816HGYR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-717043","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07816HGYR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07816HGYR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":717044,"name":"4Pcs Finger Chopsticks - Snack Chopsticks for Gamers - Fun Chopsticks, Gamer Chopsticks Snack Clips Gamepad Accessories Mobile Game Accessories (4PCS)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oFxcMCssL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This interestingly designed finger chopsticks allows you to easily eat snacks when playing computer or mobile games without worrying about getting your fingers dirty. Simply insert the index finger and middle finger into the opening hole of the finger clamp chopsticks, and place the chopsticks above the fingers, you can easily control the chopsticks to clamp the food and keep the fingers clean and oil-free. Extremely lightweight, excellent ergonomic design. It can be fixed on the finger for a long time without affecting the operation of the finger. Made of food-grade ABS plastic, easy to clean and reusable. Finger chopsticks are a practical accessory for keeping your hands clean. They can be used for work, study, games, cell phones, or any time you don't want to get your hands dirty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61oFxcMCssL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HIBILDER","source_asin":"B09QZ3MQCK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-717044","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QZ3MQCK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QZ3MQCK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":717045,"name":"Bormioli Rocco H Drink Dea Teapot with Infuser","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81y+LMiK8AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The fine tradition of the Bormioli Rocco Group coincides with the very history of glass: the first glassworks was established in Parma in 1825. The company has always demonstrated a great drive to pioneer innovation: in machinery, materials and design. Over the years it has developed a special talent, that of combining time-honoured craftsmanship and the passion of master glassmakers with modern industrial processes. Bormioli Rocco is the leading company in its sector in Italy and a great ambassador of the Made in Italy label on international markets. The H-Drink Line are all Boro-Silicate Glass Thermal shock resistant up to 100 degrees Celcius. They are all suitable for the microwave and are dishwasher safe. Each H-drink item comes with a recipe book for wellbeing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81y+LMiK8AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bormioli Rocco","source_asin":"B002AQ6Q5A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-717045","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002AQ6Q5A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002AQ6Q5A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
