window.products.push({"id":717048,"name":"TeamFar Stainless Steel Bakeware Set of 8, Baking Roasting Toaster Oven Pans, Lasagna/Square/Round Cake Pan, Loaf Pan & Muffin Pan, Non-Toxic & Durabl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VKubiLoVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"TeamFar Stainless Steel Bakeware Baking Roasting Pan Set of 8 is made of heavy duty stainless steel, healthy for daily use. The baking pan set includes different pans for baking various kinds of shapes results. The square & round cake pan for making small cakes & serving snacks. The muffin & cupcake pan is versatile enough for savory small bites and the loaf pan is ideal for bread. The rectangular pan for baking brownie. Choose TeamFar, enjoy health & fun baking life. SPECIFICATION: Material: Pure Stainless Steel Color: Silver Feature: Dishwasher & Oven Safe, Durable, Non- toxic Craft: Smooth Surface, Roll edges Package included: 8-Pieces DIMENSION 1 X Large Lasagna Pan: 12⅖ x 9¾ x 2-Inch  1 X Medium Lasagna Pan: 10.5 x 8 x 2-Inch 1 X Square Pan: 8 x 8 x2-Inch  1 X Loaf Pan: 9¼ x 5 x 2.5-Inch 2 X Round Cake Pan: 8 x 8 x2-Inch 2 X Muffin Pan: 11.3 x 7 x1.25-Inch, Cavity Size: Top：2.6-Inch, Bottom: 2-Inch Why Choose TeamFar Stainless Steel Bakeware Set? 1. Non-Toxic : Stainless steel bakeware set is healthy and safe for daily baking, No like nonstick and aluminum pans.  2. Dishwasher Safe : Dishwasher safe to save your labor and time after using, easy to clean up even by hand. 3. Unbreakable : The bakeware set is constructed by heavy gauge stainless steel, solid for a long lasting service life, while ceramic pan easily broken.  4. Economical : More economical than buy them separately, Sufficient for large & multi baking use, As an excellent tool for family gathering, holiday party, camping… USING INSTRUCTION 1. Please wash the set with warm soapy water before your first using. 2. Please clean the set with soft dishcloth, avoiding scratching the shiny surface. 3. Please clean and dry the set after using for healthy daily use, Dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VKubiLoVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TeamFar","source_asin":"B08VDFJ5XG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-717048","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VDFJ5XG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VDFJ5XG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":717049,"name":"Ashley Furniture Signature Design - Larchmont Dining Room Buffet - Burnished Dark Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719VfB+HsAL._AC_SL1128_.jpg","description":"With grand Old World design and a rich finish, the Larchmont Buffet by Ashley Furniture brings a classic beauty to the decor of any dining experience. The rich burnished dark brown finish flows over the Old World construction of the planked and pegged table tops with the thick built-up edge and the massive table legs that have a two-sided taper shape. With a strong horizontal design and stitched faux leather upholstery on the chairs, this furniture captures the true essence of Old World design. Create the perfect dining room decor with the grand style of the \"Larchmont\" dining room collection.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719VfB+HsAL._AC_SL1128_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Signature Design by Ashley","source_asin":"B01FDN7CQS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-717049","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01FDN7CQS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01FDN7CQS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
