window.products.push({"id":717076,"name":"ABI Warm White Double Density Flexible LED Light Strip with AC Adapter, 120 LED/Meter LED Chips, 5 Meters / 16.4 FT Spool, 12VDC","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BcYKNXkeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This reel of double density warm white LED strip light is designed for DIY users and lighting professionals alike. LED strip lighting is the simplest, most attractive, and cost-effective option for under-cabinet, concealed lighting, sign lighting, architectural lighting, automotive lighting and countless other applicationsInstallation is easy. The strip has an adhesive backing and a female barrel power jack. Simply stick the strip to the desired location and plug it into the included 12V adapter. The strip can be cut every 3 LEDs, allowing you to create the custom solution you have been looking for. Our professional grade double PCB has twice the copper of competing products and is more durable. It's lower resistance reduces heat, improves efficiency, and extends the product lifeColor Temperature: 2800K (Warm White) • Chip: SMD3528 • Protection Rating: IP20 (Indoor Use) • Length: 5 Meters (16.4 Feet) • LEDs: 600 (120 / Meter) • Light Output: 2200 Lumens (440 Lm. / Meter) • Voltage: 12V • Current: 2.6A (520mA / meter) • Watts: 31W (6.2W / meter) • Plug: 5.5x2.1mm Female Barrel • PCB: Professional Grade Double PCB • Adapter Specs: 12V 3.3A (40W Max)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BcYKNXkeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ABI","source_asin":"B07KPQCK61","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-717076","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KPQCK61","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KPQCK61","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
