window.products.push({"id":717215,"name":"WAYDA Rotating Spice Rack Organizer, 20 Jars Revolving Seasoning Organizer for Cabinet, Stainless Steel Spice Tower for Kitchen Countertop with Reusea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8130kiavxEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stainless steel [20 Glass Jars Spice Rack] - The spice rack organizer for countertop includes 20 empty jars (Not include spices) with built-in sieve lid, 144 pre-printed labels as well as 36 blank labels, a marker pen and a silicone funnel. Each glass jar has a silver lid on it and you must remove the protective blue film. You can use custom labels to mark condiments and spices on each glass jar for easy identification and search. [Premium Material & Durable Stable] - Spice rack organizer are made of lead-free glass, stainless steel and wood for durability and stability. The spice rack is sealed, insect-proof, moisture-proof and dust-proof. After putting the spice chute into the spice rack, the mouth is tilted upward to prevent the spices from falling out. [360 Degree Rotating Spice Rack ] - The spice rack features a rotating design that makes it easy to find ingredients and easy to use when cooking. The 360 degree rotating design allows you to quickly identify the spices and condiments in each glass jar. The bottom of the rotating spice rack features a non-slip pad to keep the rack smoothly on the table and prevent it from slipping during use. [Reusable DIY Labels] - We include 144 pre-printed labels as well as 36 blank labels and a marker pen. You can mark spices and flavorings inside each glass jar for easy identification and location. If you want to change the label text, easily erase the text from the surface with water to make changes. [Save Space & Multipurpose] - Spice racks will keep your kitchen clean and tidy and avoid messing up your countertop. Save more space and ease of use while cooking and keeping spices fresh, emphasizing the gourmet look and feel of your kitchen. It is suitable for homes, restaurants and party buffets to enhance the convenience of dining.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8130kiavxEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WAYDA","source_asin":"B09F3FD1WM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-717215","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09F3FD1WM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09F3FD1WM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
