window.products.push({"id":717351,"name":"HandyMake Seagrass Belly Basket – 10 Basket Planter Styles in Small, Medium or Large for Home Décor, Laundry, Storage, Toy Organizer, Picnic, Nursery ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JbONn7HnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HandyMake introduces another elegant and practical piece to your home décor collection with a Natural Seagrass Belly Basket for everyday use. Seagrass is an important plant making up shallow marine environments and typically used to make furniture or crafts. This all-purpose plant basket is perfect for home décor, pillow basket, towel basket, blanket storage, quilts storage, creative storage, vegetable storage, kitchen, picnic, grocery baskets, plant pot covers, flower pots, laundry, toy organizer, and nursery hamper. Our super cute belly basket is uniquely hand crafted by artisans in southeast Asia. Artisans don’t use fake wild seagrass plants, only 100% sustainably grown seagrass. Seagrass baskets are eco-friendly, beautiful, sturdy, and ultrastylish with texture for any room. Their woven design adds a breezy touch to your décor while its neutral hue fits well in a monochromatic color palette. The sea grass basket is also a bridge for coastal aesthetic. Perfect for magazines, baby supplies, linens, books, photo albums, or on-the-go accessories for practical function and natural beauty. Our basket planter is simple and easy to fit on a shelf as well as centerpiece for a living room. Incredibly beautiful and delightful, these baskets have ten (10) different basket styles and variations in small, medium, and large. Improve existing living space with seagrass baskets that can fit in cabinets, or sit on a shelf, while providing optimal storage without sacrificing appearance. They are the perfect gift for anyone who manages the home. We hope you enjoy this attractive belly basket as it has several uses including your next family gathering, cookout, barbeque, wedding shower, birthday party, anniversary party, or special event. We’ve taken great care to the small details to provide excellent style and ease of use. Get started and Order Today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JbONn7HnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HandyMake","source_asin":"B07HYT8D42","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-717351","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HYT8D42","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HYT8D42","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
