window.products.push({"id":717356,"name":"Svago ZGR Plus Zero Gravity Chair (SV395) Vibration Massage Power Recline Memory Foam Pillow Heat Therapy (Chestnut/Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":1999.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RsrTLsADL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DEFY GRAVITY AND DECOMPRESS WITH SVAGOSvago took extra steps to make their 2nd generation Zero Gravity recliner revolutionary. It can be used as a traditional recliner or a Zero-Gravity chair and has the look and the feel of fine furniture, The Svago chair uses your body's natural shape to help you achieve a state of total relaxation - from cushioning that eliminates tension to power recline that makes it easier to find the most comfortable position. Unlike other Zero gravity chairs, you can control the backrest and footrest separately. Using the convenient remote control, this allows you to put the chair in any position you find comfortable – for watching television to enjoying a relaxing massage. Zero gravity chairs help maximize lung performance and optimizes the flow of oxygen-rich blood to critical organs. This position is the body’s natural resting position, and it affords exceptional relief from lower back stress while also placing your heart on an equal plane with your body mass, thereby minimizing the effort required to pump blood throughout your body. Upholstered in synthetic leather, the Cozzia features a solid birch wood base, power recline with dual articulators, vibra massage, lumbar heat, an independently adjustable headrest, independently adjustable footrest, a footrest extension for additional support, footrest extension and a removable sensi-temp foam lumbar pillow. Available in four colors: midnight black, chestnut brown, cognac and snowfall – all with a black wood finish. Specifications: height 47.5”, width 30.7”, depth closed 43.3”, reclined: 63”, overall 74.5\". Chair weight 110 lbs. Weighty capacity: 300 lbsFEATURES Zero Gravity Position Synthetic Polyurethane Leather Independently Adjustable Headrest Independently Adjustable Footrest Footrest Extension Removable Sensi-Temp Foam Lumbar Pillow Heat Therapy Seat Vibration Massage Remote Control","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RsrTLsADL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cozzia","source_asin":"B07BHWT57W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-717356","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BHWT57W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BHWT57W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
