window.products.push({"id":717449,"name":"Waverly Grand Bazaar 18 Square Inch Embroidered Accent Pillow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UcfM3ZQzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Grand Bazaar Comforter Set is crafted of 100-Percent cotton and woven to create a gently textured, soft hand. Each set includes one reversible comforter, one tailored bedskirt and two coordinating pillow shams. Reversible comforter offers a transitional versatility with designs inspired by period motifs from the Ottoman Empire reversing to an ethnic collage of medallions and paisley. The design comes to life with rich jewel tones of burnt orange, fern green and deep burgundy accented by neutral shades of clay and cream. Comforter and shams are finished with decorative grosgrain ribbon trim. Designs from the reversible comforter adorn the coordinating accessories. Coordinating window treatments include a pair of curtain panels with tiebacks and valance. Complete your bedroom retreat with coordinating window treatments. Hang two curtain panels and a valance with decorative tiebacks for complete window ensemble. Each panel offers easy-to-hang rod-pocket or back-tab for your choice of hanging options. Scalloped window valance features an all-over Ottoman inspired design of florals and leaves in rich jewel tones. Lovely contrasting vertical stripe insets make this valance a must-have. Each window valance offers a 3'' rod-pocket with 2'' decorative topper. Gather valance for desired top affect. Enhance the ensemble by layering on the coordinating european sham with decorative ribbon trim. No bedroom oasis is complete without delicately embellished accent pillows. The Waverly Grand Bazaar Collection offers a lovely 18'' square embroidered pillow with zipper closure, 20'' square pillow with mitered stitching and covered button, 20'' square pillow with stacked pleats and a 14'' oblong pillow with double-sided french tie closures. The queen comforter measures 92'' x 96''. The king comforter set measures 110\" by 96\". Queen set ships with two standard shams. King set ships with two king shams. Tailored bed skirt offers a deep 15\" drop. Imported. Accessories sold separately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UcfM3ZQzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WAVERLY","source_asin":"B007VY819K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-717449","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007VY819K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007VY819K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
