window.products.push({"id":717824,"name":"Sharp Kitchen Knife Set, YOSFO 6-Piece Colorful Kitchen Knives Set with Non-stick Coating, German Stainless Steel Professional Chef's Knife Set, Multi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61044Qq6MnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE ASSORTED KNIFE SET YOU'VE BEEN LOOKING FOR: YOSFO 6 Piece Colored Knife Sets are durable and long-lasting thanks to tough stainless steel and superior forging process that resist dulling, rusting, and chipping. These kitchen knives set also feature a nonstick and scratch resistant coating for easy cutting. Make you slice and dice like a pro ESSENTIAL KITCHEN KNIVES SET FOR EVERY OCCASION: This Cutlery Set Includes, 8\" Chef's Knife, 8\" Slicer Knife, 8\" Bread Knife, 4.5\" Utility Knife, 3.5\" Paring Knife, Peeler. From heavy-duty chopping to intricate slicing, you’ll have the perfect knife for every cutting task with this essential set EXCELLENT SHARP & LONG EDGE RETENTION: Hand-honed blades offer a superior razor-sharp edge and retain their edge for long-lasting precision cutting at least 5 times longer than other ordinary cutlery COLOR YOUR LIFE: The stainless steel blades of this 6 Piece Colored Knife Set are colored with a corrosion resistant, stick resistant coating. Different colors help you remember which knife was used on meats and vegetables, helping reduces confusion. The vibrant colors also brighten your counter and renovate the kitchen, which makes the room very warm and makes cooking fun YOSFO LIFETIME LIMITED WARRANTY: This kitchen knives set comes with a lifetime warranty so you can be confident that your investment is protected. Any piece found to be defective under normal use and care will be repaired or replaced at no charge with the same item or an item of equal or better value","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61044Qq6MnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YOSFO","source_asin":"B08JZ37QY5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-717824","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JZ37QY5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JZ37QY5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
