window.products.push({"id":717853,"name":"Cooling Blanket for Hot Sleepers Night Sweats Japanese Q-Max>0.4 Arc-Chill Cooling Fiber Keep Adults/Children Cool All Night Twin Size Cool Summer Bla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":46.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819yxAEX40L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Japanese Q-max >0.4 (Regular Fiber is Just 0.2.) Arc-chill Pro Cooling Fibers, Help for Night Sweat and Hot Sleeper Keep Cool and Dry All Night. 💎SUPER-COOL FEELING: Even in warm and hot summer weather, you will feel really cool with this cool summer blanket. Uses Japanese Q-Max >0.4 (regular fiber is just 0.2) Arc-Chill Pro Cooling Fibers to brilliantly absorb body heat. Makes you cool and comfortable. 💎DOUBLE-SIDED DESIGN: Special 80% mica nylon and 20% PE Arc-Chill Pro cool fabric on the top side make the cool quilt blanket feel comfortable, breathable, and cool in the hottest summers. Natural 100% cotton on the bottom inside is great for spring and autumn. The cold bed blanket is a great help for night sweats and hot sleepers — it’ll keep you cool and dry all night. 💎LIGHTWEIGHT BED BLANKET: This summer cooling blanket measures 59 x 79 inches. It’s so lightweight that you can easily take it anywhere. The thin cool blanket is a perfect companion in the car, airplane, train, or anywhere else you travel and want a comfortable blanket! 💎EASY TO CLEAN: These soft bed blankets are fully machine-washable. We suggest you put your cooling throw blanket inside a laundry net bag to prevent entanglement and damage, and to keep your blanket fresh and clean. PLEASE NOTE: don’t put the bed blanket in the dryer or dry it in sun; don’t bleach or iron. 💎WIDELY USE: This cool cotton blanket will quickly become your favorite purchase. You can use this cool throw blanket at home and in your car — also can keep another at work. BUY IT NOW, while we have this exceptional new cool technology in plentiful supply. The blanket for night sweats makes a great birthday gift, holiday present, or anniversary gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819yxAEX40L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LUXEAR","source_asin":"B08PD1YPFV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-717853","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PD1YPFV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PD1YPFV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
