window.products.push({"id":717856,"name":"Saffron Marigold Midnight Lotus Lightweight Bedspread | 100% Cotton Cobalt Blue Asian Oriental Persian Floral Quilt Comforter Cover | Unique Jacobean ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":115.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ePW6GARaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Saffron Marigold Midnight Lotus Bedspread Crisp, elegant and timeless, this print pays homage to the intrinsic purity of the lotus blossom. Use as a light coverlet on a warm night and you could wake up with a renewed sense of purpose and spirit. Tap into the Zen quality and accessorize with rice paper lamps, Asian pottery and candles. Soft, subdued lighting will keep the mood gentle and relaxed. Features: This cotton bedspread is printed on preshrunk, superior grade, soft cotton and finished with neat double stitched hems. This cotton bedspread is printed on preshrunk, superior grade, soft cotton and finished with neat double stitched hems. Single sheet, lightweight, not quilted. Single sheet, lightweight, not quilted. Hand printed using intricately carved wooden blocks. Hand printed using intricately carved wooden blocks. Wash & Care Our floral bedding should be washed separately in cold water with a gentle or eco friendly detergent. Do not use detergents with bleach or phosphates. Tumble dry warm. Iron using cotton settings. Inspiration for Midnight Lotus: Envision a lotus pond at midnight ... replete with ethereal white lotus blossoms, sinuously intertwined, floating gently on deep cobalt blue waters. The lotus enjoys rich material and spiritual symbolism in Indias arts, religions and systems of thought. The lotus, in which the gods discovered their grace and majesty; artists the subtlest expression of beauty; and mystics, dimensions of mysticism and intricate cosmic existence; is the primary flower of India. Since the lotus blooms from the underworld into light, the lotus motif is symbolically associated with transcending of mans spirit over worldly matters.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ePW6GARaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Saffron Marigold","source_asin":"B07BHZKSRF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-717856","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BHZKSRF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BHZKSRF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
