window.products.push({"id":717908,"name":"RUNTOP Camping Fan with LED Lantern,10400mAh 8 Inch Portable Tent Fan, Up to 25H 270°Oscillating Rechargeable Battery Operated Fan with Hook,Foldable ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SYfEucoGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【270 ° Automatic Oscillating & Hook Design】 Camping fans for tents, 8 Inch oscillating fan supports 270 ° rotational adjustment, allowing you to obtain airflow from different directions. Built in foldable hooks, tent fan can be better hung on tents, cars, branches, walls, outdoors, or simply hung on a table at home or in the office. 【Long Working Time】 The portable fan is powered by the high capacity battery, and can operate continuously for 10-25 hours after being fully charged. The battery operated fan supports working while charging and wireless use, and can be charged within 6 hours. Whether it's at home, office, or outdoors, it's your first choice. Allows you enjoy the cool breeze all day long. 【Powerful but Ultra Quiet Wind】Our battery powered fan use professional high-performance brushless motors, with one-button stepless speed control buttons that can rotate to the most comfortable wind speed according to your needs. NO Noisy, USB fans provide you with cool air circulation while ensuring a quiet experience without interference. 【3-Level LED Lights & Emergency Power Bank】Equipped with 2 LED lights in the front and back. The camping fan adopts a 3 level brightness LED light design,soft and non glare, can meet your outdoor lighting needs at night. Don't worry about running out of batteries when you're out. Our outdoor travel fan supports reverse charging, which can charge your phone, GPS, and iPod device. The USB Rechargeable fan is a lifesaving straw for camping /traveling,hurricane season, and other emergencies, making it an ideal companion for your outdoor activities! 【Resistant & Foldable Tripod Design】The desk fan battery operated is made of drop resistant PP material and an impact resistant housing. The Camping Fan with LED Lantern is a professional outdoor device that is easy to carry and store. As a foldaway desktop fan, it is very suitable for rooms and offices. You can use it for outdoor work, such as camping, hiking, car maintenance, picnic, barbecue, fishing, travel etc., as well as indoor places such as offices, bedrooms, family gatherings, gardens, etc. Folding triangle design,more stable","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SYfEucoGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RUNTOP","source_asin":"B0C39QKHG1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-717908","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C39QKHG1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C39QKHG1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
