window.products.push({"id":717923,"name":"Majestic Goods Desk Set, Six Piece, Brown Oak Wood and PU (W232)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41OF6+poEnL._AC_.jpg","description":"This elegant set comes with a double letter tray, memo holder, business card holder, double pen stand, pencil cup and paper clip holder.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41OF6+poEnL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Majestic Goods","source_asin":"B002W6ZVBS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-717923","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002W6ZVBS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002W6ZVBS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":717924,"name":"Rae Dunn Bee Gnome - Honey Bee Decor - Bee Gnomes Decorations for Home & Office, Bumble Bee Farmhouse Kitchen Decoration, Stuffed Gnomes Plush Shelf F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZOvNoZmOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"To bee or not to bee, that is the question. Beauty is in the eye of the bee-holder, and you can make sure you’re getting your daily dose of Vitamin Bee with this decorative plush gnome from Rae Dunn! Guests and gift recipients will be buzzing about this sweet piece of home decor. Bee positive, bee proud, and bee yourself.PRODUCT FEATURES:Honey Bee GnomePlush Gnome DecorShelf Sized DecorationDimensions: 7” x 5.25” x 19”AVAILABLE STYESLS:\"Bee Sweet\"\"Bee Kind\"\"Sweet Honey\"CUDDLY CUTE DECOROur nifty gnomes are soft and sturdy with a weighted fabric design that ensures they stay standing upright. Padded fabric body and tiny plush hands are a delight to squeeze, with a cute wooden nose and themed outfit to complete the look. Adorn shelves, bedrooms, desktops, offices, tables, fireplace mantel, windowsills, bookcases, refrigerator, furniture, and nooks & crannies throughout the home with these adorable figurines.SCANDINAVIAN GOOD LUCK GIFTIn Swedish and Scandinavian homes, gnomes or “tomten” can stand for good fortune, respect, and care. Stories about these creatures often talk about how much they appreciate people looking after their properties and farms and being good to the animals that live there. Give a gift of good luck to friends, family, coworkers, or teachers.RAE DUNNCalifornia artist, ceramicist and author, Rae Dunn, finds beauty in simple shapes, imperfection and found objects. \"In my own way, I am driven to find the balance between expressing something that is deeply meaningful to me and creating a sense of joy that might quietly touch the lives of others.Rae's designs are known for their functionality, design, and durability. Rae's signature font gives every item a personal touch and adds to the simple beauty of her designs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZOvNoZmOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rae Dunn","source_asin":"B09XYY2LMS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-717924","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XYY2LMS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XYY2LMS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":717925,"name":"NEST Fragrances Reed Diffuser- Moss & Mint , 5.9 fl oz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":67.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71i9ClyyC5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The moss and mint reed diffuser by NEST fragrances is a blend of garden mint, apple blossom and muguet that are infused with a touch of oakmoss and vetiver. The nest diffusers are carefully crafted with the highest quality fragrance oils and are designed to continuously fill your home with a lush, memorable fragrance. The alcohol-free formula releases fragrance slowly and evenly into the air for approximately 90 days. To intensify the fragrance, occasionally flip the reeds over.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71i9ClyyC5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NEST Fragrances","source_asin":"B0074491U0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-717925","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0074491U0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0074491U0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":717926,"name":"Digital Touch Multifunction Kitchen Food Scale for Precise Weighing in Grams, Ounces, Pounds, Fluid Oz, Milliliters Measures up to 11lb/5kg Best Gift ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81N6KUOgMGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Have you been looking for the perfect kitchen scale? One that is accurate, lightweight, reliable and easy to use? Look no further - the Procizion food scale with its elegant tempered-glass surface is exactly what you have been looking for. Whether you are preparing a special meal or measuring your food for your weight loss program, this kitchen scale delivers. No longer do you need to subtract the container weight to calculate your food and ingredients, the Tare feature instantly calculates the net weight of the ingredients (and automatically subtracts the container weight to calculate the weight of the ingredients being weighed). Accuracy - This scale is extremely accurate. You are measuring your ingredients for a reason; your gram scale must be accurate! This digital kitchen scale is equipped with 4 new, high-precision GFX sensors. This scale provides accurate measurements from 0.1 oz. to 11 lbs. (1 gm - 5250 gm) with a bright blue large backlit LCD. Your kitchen is a place where the family gathers, a place where magic happens. Sleek, sophisticated and beautiful, your Procizion touch scale is sure to bring compliments from your guests. Combining new advanced, touch-sensitive buttons, a tempered glass surface and new GFX sensors, this scale is one of the industry most advanced digital food scale. The Procizion scale combines all this technology into a contemporary thin design and stands out as a showpiece for the modern kitchen. Designed for the culinary perfectionist and constant bakers who desires superior accuracy and beautiful design, this scale is one of the lightest kitchen scales on the market and offers easy portability. Chefs and Calorie Counters: your lives just got a whole lot easier! Thanks to the Procizion Scale, you can now follow your recipes to the \"T\" and know exactly what size your portion is.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81N6KUOgMGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Procizion","source_asin":"B077519PMT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-717926","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077519PMT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077519PMT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
