window.products.push({"id":717991,"name":"Melange 40-Piece Porcelain Dinnerware Set (Cascades) | Service for 8 | Microwave, Dishwasher & Oven Safe | Dinner Plate, Salad Plate, Soup Bowl, Cup &","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kPiYeLAWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About Melange Melange dinnerware is all about treating you to everyday elegance. We believe fine dinner sets shouldn’t mean fragile dinner sets. We believe every meal should be complemented by dinnerware that makes you smile. That’s why we’ve used premium materials to bring on the durability, special craftsmanship to enhance the longevity, and lovely detailing to catch anyone’s eye. An Everyday Porcelain Dinner Plate Set Designed to Last and Impress Impress your guests, crown that dinner party, or upgrade your everyday dinnerware with an elegant porcelain coupe dinner set that epitomizes durability. We’ve combined high-quality porcelain with a unique chip-resistant design to create a porcelain set that you can use every single day without dealing with constant cracking, flaking, or chipping. - Vitrified at temperatures of over 2480F. - Microwave, oven and dishwasher safe. - 0% porosity for greater durability. - Complete set for service of 4 or 8. - Elegant floral pattern and lovely glaze. Designed to Last We’ve adopted a premium approach to treat you to a dinner plate set that will serve you for years. Not only is the porcelain treated at higher temperatures to make it much stronger but the place sets have special rounded edges that keep chipping at bay, and the high-heat treated porcelain never absorbs any moisture that leads to cracking like others do. For Daily Use No dealing with fragile porcelain dinner sets that you only whip out whenever you have company. Melange dinnerware is strong enough to handle the rigors of daily use. You can safely use it in the microwave, clean it in the dishwasher without breaking, and even use it to reheat food in the oven up to 400F. Everything You Need Every set comes with a dinner plate, salad plate, soup bowl and a mug; everything you need to serve your family or guests a full course meal. Choose between our 16-piece set that comes with 4 of each piece of cutlery and serves 4, or our 32-piece dinner set that comes with 8 of each and serves 8. Understated Elegance Simple yet eye-catching, our range of designs exude an effortless elegance that blends into just about any setting. Beautifully done floral detailing meets lovely colors and a well-done glaze to create porcelain place settings with a premium feel. Get one set for yourself and a couple more as gifts and experience the magic of Melange.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kPiYeLAWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Melange","source_asin":"B01B7DEWTI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-717991","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01B7DEWTI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01B7DEWTI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":717992,"name":"Spiffing Prints London City Map Beacon Travelers Pocket Map 1890 - Medium - Semi Gloss - Unframed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pty2nOHBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Spiffing Prints - Fine Art Prints All of our prints include borders, these can be seen in the image in the listing. If you would like to have your border removed then please get in touch and we can remove it. Small 210mm by 297mm Small 210mm by 297mm Medium 297mm by 420mm Medium 297mm by 420mm Large 420mm by 594 Large 420mm by 594 Extra Large 594mm by 841mm Extra Large 594mm by 841mm Our Papers Semi-Gloss 210gsm This paper is the lightest of the three and has a partially glossed surface, similar to the finish of a magazine page. There isn't as much reflection as a full gloss paper which is what a typical photograph would be classed as. The gloss allows the colours to come through full and vibrant. Matte 230gsm This is a thicker paper with a matte surface, is slightly off-white, and is textured. Matte paper allows ink to soak into it meaning you get richer and deeper colours, especially when it comes to darker colours. Archival Matte 300gsm This paper is textured similar to that of watercolour paper, is off-white, and has a matte surface. This paper is specifically designed for high quality fine art printing and so it has a larger range of gamut of colour available. The archival quality is because it is not made with artificial whiteners also known as acids. These acids can break down ink over years, especially if the print is exposed to sunlight. You can be assured with our 100% satisfaction guarantee. If you are unhappy with your order then we are happy to arrange the return so you can buy in confidence. Any questions, just ask.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pty2nOHBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Spiffing Prints","source_asin":"B07NS141Z9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-717992","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NS141Z9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NS141Z9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
